{"translation-revision-date":"2026-10-01 12:00+0000","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.9.0","source":"assets\/build\/admin\/index.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"cs_CZ","plural-forms":"nplurals=3; plural=(n == 1) ? 0 : ((n >= 2 && n <= 4) ? 1 : 2);"},"page title\u0004Related Posts":["Related Posts"],"Resume":["Pokra\u010dovat"],"The settings could not be loaded.":["Nastaven\u00ed se nepoda\u0159ilo na\u010d\u00edst."],"The installer could not be reached.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se spojit s instal\u00e1torem."],"Installer":["Instal\u00e1tor"],"All set! Your posts are linked.":["Hotovo! Va\u0161e p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky jsou propojen\u00e9."],"All set! Your posts are read.":["Hotovo! Va\u0161e p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky jsou p\u0159e\u010dten\u00e9."],"Every post shows its related posts now, and new posts are linked when you publish them.":["Ka\u017ed\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek nyn\u00ed zobrazuje sv\u00e9 souvisej\u00edc\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky a nov\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky se propoj\u00ed, jakmile je publikujete."],"Link them from the %s tab when you are ready.":["A\u017e budete p\u0159ipraveni, propojte je na kart\u011b %s."],"Close":["Zav\u0159\u00edt"],"Less than a minute left":["Zb\u00fdv\u00e1 m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e minuta"],"About %s minute left":["Zb\u00fdv\u00e1 asi %s minuta","Zb\u00fdvaj\u00ed asi %s minuty","Zb\u00fdv\u00e1 asi %s minut"],"%1$s (%2$s\/%3$s)":["%1$s (%2$s\/%3$s)"],"%1$s of %2$s posts":["%1$s z %2$s p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f"],"The installation stopped":["Instalace se zastavila"],"The installation was cancelled":["Instalace byla zru\u0161ena"],"Linking your related posts":["Propojov\u00e1n\u00ed va\u0161ich souvisej\u00edc\u00edch p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f"],"This runs in the background. You can leave this page; it goes on without you.":["Prob\u00edh\u00e1 to na pozad\u00ed. Tuto str\u00e1nku m\u016f\u017eete opustit; v\u0161e pob\u011b\u017e\u00ed d\u00e1l i bez v\u00e1s."],"%d%%":["%d %%"],"Installation progress":["Pr\u016fb\u011bh instalace"],"Background processing is slow on this site, so this page is doing the work now. Keep it open to finish sooner, or come back later.":["\u00dalohy na pozad\u00ed jsou na tomto webu pomal\u00e9, tak\u017ee pr\u00e1ci te\u010f vykon\u00e1v\u00e1 tato str\u00e1nka. Nechte ji otev\u0159enou, aby v\u0161e skon\u010dilo d\u0159\u00edve, nebo se vra\u0165te pozd\u011bji."],"Something went wrong.":["N\u011bco se pokazilo."],"What was done so far is kept. Resume to finish the rest.":["V\u0161e, co u\u017e bylo hotovo, z\u016fstane zachov\u00e1no. Pokra\u010dov\u00e1n\u00edm dokon\u010d\u00edte zbytek."],"Cancel":["Zru\u0161it"],"The installation could not resume.":["V instalaci se nepoda\u0159ilo pokra\u010dovat."],"Cancel the installation?":["Zru\u0161it instalaci?"],"Cancel installation":["Zru\u0161it instalaci"],"Keep running":["Nechat b\u011b\u017eet"],"The installation could not be cancelled.":["Instalaci se nepoda\u0159ilo zru\u0161it."],"What was done so far is kept, and you can resume later.":["V\u0161e, co u\u017e bylo hotovo, z\u016fstane zachov\u00e1no a pokra\u010dovat m\u016f\u017eete pozd\u011bji."],"Related posts per post":["Po\u010det souvisej\u00edc\u00edch p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f u p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku"],"Get started":["Za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1me"],"Let's link your related posts":["Poj\u010fme propojit va\u0161e souvisej\u00edc\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky"],"Related Posts reads your posts once to learn what each one is about, then links every post to the posts that are most related to it.":["Related Posts jednou p\u0159e\u010dte va\u0161e p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky, aby zjistil, o \u010dem ka\u017ed\u00fd z nich je, a pak propoj\u00ed ka\u017ed\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek s p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky, kter\u00e9 s n\u00edm nejv\u00edce souvisej\u00ed."],"It runs in the background, so you can leave this page while it works.":["Prob\u00edh\u00e1 to na pozad\u00ed, tak\u017ee tuto str\u00e1nku m\u016f\u017eete mezit\u00edm opustit."],"You can change this later, and link again at any time.":["Pozd\u011bji to m\u016f\u017eete zm\u011bnit a kdykoli propojit znovu."],"Link the posts right away":["Propojit p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky hned"],"Turn this off to only read the posts now, and link them later from the %s tab.":["Vypn\u011bte, chcete-li p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky te\u010f jen p\u0159e\u010d\u00edst a propojit je pozd\u011bji na kart\u011b %s."],"The installation could not start.":["Instalaci se nepoda\u0159ilo spustit."],"Start":["Spustit"],"The installation is done.":["Instalace je dokon\u010dena."],"The installation stopped.":["Instalace se zastavila."],"Version %s":["Verze %s"],"Premium":["Premium"],"Related Posts settings":["Nastaven\u00ed Related Posts"],"Unsaved changes":["Neulo\u017een\u00e9 zm\u011bny"],"You have unsaved changes.":["M\u00e1te neulo\u017een\u00e9 zm\u011bny."],"Discard":["Zahodit"],"Settings saved.":["Nastaven\u00ed bylo ulo\u017eeno."],"The settings could not be saved.":["Nastaven\u00ed se nepoda\u0159ilo ulo\u017eit."],"Save changes":["Ulo\u017eit zm\u011bny"],"This page does not exist.":["Tato str\u00e1nka neexistuje."],"Restore default":["Obnovit v\u00fdchoz\u00ed"],"This option is overwritten by a filter.":["Tato mo\u017enost je p\u0159eps\u00e1na filtrem."],"An installation is running. You can start another one when it is done.":["Prob\u00edh\u00e1 instalace. Dal\u0161\u00ed m\u016f\u017eete spustit, a\u017e bude dokon\u010dena."],"Link new posts":["Propojit nov\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky"],"Read and link the posts that are not linked yet, for example posts from before automatic linking was on. Links that exist stay as they are.":["P\u0159e\u010dte a propoj\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky, kter\u00e9 je\u0161t\u011b nejsou propojen\u00e9, nap\u0159\u00edklad p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky z doby p\u0159ed zapnut\u00edm automatick\u00e9ho propojov\u00e1n\u00ed. St\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00ed propojen\u00ed z\u016fstanou beze zm\u011bny."],"Rebuild everything":["V\u0161e znovu sestavit"],"Start over: remove every related post link, also the links you added by hand, read all posts again and link them. Your posts themselves are never touched.":["Za\u010d\u00edt znovu: odstran\u00ed v\u0161echna propojen\u00ed souvisej\u00edc\u00edch p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f, v\u010detn\u011b t\u011bch, kter\u00e1 jste p\u0159idali ru\u010dn\u011b, znovu p\u0159e\u010dte v\u0161echny p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky a propoj\u00ed je. Samotn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky z\u016fstanou v\u017edy nedot\u010den\u00e9."],"Rebuild everything?":["V\u0161e znovu sestavit?"],"Remove links and rebuild":["Odstranit propojen\u00ed a sestavit znovu"],"Keep my links":["Ponechat moje propojen\u00ed"],"Every related post link is removed, including the links you added by hand. This can not be undone.":["V\u0161echna propojen\u00ed souvisej\u00edc\u00edch p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f budou odstran\u011bna, v\u010detn\u011b t\u011bch, kter\u00e1 jste p\u0159idali ru\u010dn\u011b. Tuto akci nelze vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt."]}}}